      <div type="clause" n="46.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 46.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif ðonne Englisc onstal ga forð, onsace þonne be twyfealdum. Gif hit ðonne bið Wilisc onstal, ne bið se að na ðy mara.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If an Englishman pursues the accusation, let him deny it by two-fold [oath]. If, however, a Welshman pursues the accusation, the oath is no greater [than 60].</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If an Englishman brings the accusation, then he shall deny [the charge] by an oath of double [this] value ; on the other hand, if the accusation is brought by a Welshman, the [value of] the oath shall not be increased.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif ðonne Englisc onstal gá forð, onsace þonne be twyfealdum; gif hit þonne biþ Wilisc onstál, ne bið se að :: :: mara.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
